+"""Build the P1 evidence pack (docs/evidence/p1) in the canonical tier
+format: baseline.log, p1-crypto.log, example.log, campaign/result.json,
+gates.txt, inventory.txt, nc.log, nc-suite.log, report.md, SHA256SUMS.
