+Golden aggregate digest (the P1 report canonical form):
+  p1b|02daa5a3698437b44c9356ba317fc0b07e10a8226d6ac792b599148e253ca3c5|
+  cc5b0e9e932a00ca5acc4dbec21c0f77f0a548c1f7fdc6a89fb742def1a6ab2d|
